# The shard's unstamped watermark lives in memory. Restarting without taking
# every offset below the allocator as possibly unstamped forgets an unstamped
# append made before the restart, so a later stamped append reports nothing.
# The duplicate is switched off to keep the combined check small; the trace
# needs only one activation.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestRestartForgetsUnstamped
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a restarted shard forgets the unstamped appends made before it
PERTURBS: Restart
BOUNDS: WithMixedVersion = TRUE, WithRestart = TRUE, WithDuplicate = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ lastU' = next - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the watermark is lost.
    /\ lastU' = -1
--- END